{
  "key": 21543,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0325_R02R0501_Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_ManyMonsOnlyInForests",
      "en_US": [
        "Many Pokémon live only in forests \n",
        "and caves.\r",
        "You need to be persistent and look\n",
        "everywhere to get different kinds."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0325_R02R0501_Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCutSkinnyTrees",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you noticed the skinny trees\n",
        "on the roadside?\r",
        "They can be cut down by a special\n",
        "Pokémon move, I hear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0325_R02R0501_Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCancelEvolution",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know the evolution-cancel\n",
        "technique?\r",
        "When a Pokémon is evolving, you\n",
        "can stop the process.\r",
        "It’s a technique for raising\n",
        "Pokémon the way they are."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0325_R02R0501_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
